<title>UK: BGL sets 100 mln mark Dec 2003 bond.</title>
<headline>BGL sets 100 mln mark Dec 2003 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Banque Generale du Luxembourg SA.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BANQUE GENERALE DU LUXEMBOURG SA</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN DEM   COUPON     5.125     MATURITY    22.DEC.03</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.85    PAY DATE    22.APR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.25	REOFFER    99.90     SPREAD	+15 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AA3	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AA-	 DENOMS (K) 1-10	SALE LIMITS US/UK/DE</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    LUX	 HOME CTRY  LUX	 TAX PROVS   STD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.30	SELL CONC  1.95	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 6.0 PCT BUND DUE 2003</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
